(text "LOCAL REGULATOR ONLY - input 5 V +/-5%, dedicated ADE9430 rail.\nJ1 supplied externally; flags describe this explicit input contract.\nGND is mains-referenced through VN_SENSE. Isolation is NOT implemented here.\nBudget 50 mA for this rail; MCU/HMI require separate power budgeting.\nNo direct mains energization until input protection and isolation are validated." (at 25.4 139.7 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "7c0bc25c-d34e-4bb7-88b6-a799c2e82cd6"))
